# Why this Module's primary service carries no `healthcheck:`.
# A marker with no justification is a silent skip in file form; lint-config
# refuses an empty one.

The pinned image grafana/loki:3.7.7 is distroless. Verified 2026-09-07 by
exporting the image filesystem: it holds /usr/bin/loki and nothing else — no
/bin/sh, no /busybox, no wget, no HTTP client of any kind — so `docker run
--entrypoint /bin/sh grafana/loki:3.7.7` fails with "stat /bin/sh: no such file
or directory". A Docker healthcheck has nothing to execute. The readiness gate
is not lost: services/loki/smoke.sh polls /ready from the host before the OTLP
round-trip, and SMOKE_STRICT=1 fails on it.
